[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5207232318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122163#issuecomment-5207232318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122163","id":5207232318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNmAPPg","user":{"login":"ominousllama","id":149961466,"node_id":"U_kgDOCPA6-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149961466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama","html_url":"https://github.com/ominousllama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T16:00:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T16:00:26Z","body":"Do any other Vulkan apps show this kind of behaviour?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5207232318/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208667733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122163#issuecomment-5208667733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122163","id":5208667733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNnX2VQ","user":{"login":"lilykai-strawberry","id":291263695,"node_id":"U_kgDOEVxUzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291263695?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry","html_url":"https://github.com/lilykai-strawberry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lilykai-strawberry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T19:45:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T19:45:47Z","body":"I tried running `vkcube --validate` and it didn't show any errors. \n\nLooking through past issues i found #122118 and while I'm not that experienced with the whole graphics stack I noticed the following similarities:\n \n- Both are issues on Linux when using Vulkan on an Nvidia GPU.\n- Both issues don't appear when using OpenGL.\n- The bug's seemingly random triggers appear consistent with some sort of race condition, the thing that TSAN checks for.\n\nI'll try to see if I can replicate that bug on my machine to see if it could be related","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208667733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5210116407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122163#issuecomment-5210116407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122163","id":5210116407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNowRNw","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T23:59:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T23:59:02Z","body":"That issue with TSAN happens because it can't intercept some calls inside the NVIDIA drivers when Godot is creating a Vulkan device, so TSAN's internal logic gets broken. And as you can see, when TSAN is not present Godot should work normally.\n\nInfo to be on topic, I have never seen this issue on:\n> Godot v4.8.dev (457470a8d) - EndeavourOS `#1` SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:49:51 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (nvidia; 610.43.03) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.49 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":nul